    <data key="d0">Fyber Data Processing and Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lHM96P5kP2k</data>
    <data key="d2">Fyber processes ~15 million ad events per second. Migrating Spark workloads from Hadoop/Yarn to EKS with Spotinst achieved ~90% cost savings.</data>
